                            <button onClick={handleRestoreDefaults} className="w-full py-3 bg-indigo-600/30 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 border border-indigo-500/50 rounded-xl font-bold text-indigo-300 shadow-lg text-sm">
                                🛠 기본 템플릿(4종) 강제 복구
                            </button>
